               "summary":  "ANET fell 11.59% to $167.62 on 20 Nov 2026 in a broad AI sell-off (Nasdaq −5.28%, Nvidia −14%), with no Arista-specific news behind it. The chart has turned weak: price is below all three EMAs on 1.5× normal volume and RSI is 41.47. However, the EMAs are still in bullish order and MACD has not yet turned down. The business looks strong: Q3 revenue rose 58.5%, Q4 guidance is $3.9–4.0B, and the 2027 outlook is about $18.5B. The EOS software moat is intact. The near-term risk is valuation and sentiment about AI spending, not Arista\u0027s execution. Support is near $158; resistance is at $171.67, then $182–187."
